  "# Markdown 实时预览\n\n在浏览器本地**安全渲染**，*无需联网*。\n\n## 支持的语法\n- 标题、**加粗**、*斜体*、`行内代码`\n- [链接](https://example.com)（仅允许安全链接）\n- 有序列表：\n1. 第一项\n2. 第二项\n\n> 引用块也可以正常显示。\n\n```\nconst code = \"代码块使用等宽字体\";\n```\n": "# Markdown real-time preview\n\n**Safe rendering** locally in the browser, *no internet connection required*.\n\n## Supported syntax\n- Title, **bold**, *italics*, `inline code`\n- [Link](https://example.com) (only safe links allowed)\n-Ordered list:\n1. The first item\n2. The second item\n\n> Quoted blocks can also be displayed normally.\n\n```\nconst code = \"Code blocks use fixed-width font\";\n```",
  "# 在此输入 Markdown…": "# Enter Markdown here…",
  "# 按尺寸缩放": "# Scale by size",
  "# 标题\n\n正文里可以用 **粗体**、*斜体* 和 `行内代码`。\n\n- 列表\n- 还有表格、引用、代码块": "# Title\n\nYou can use **bold**, *italics* and `inline code` in the text.\n\n- List\n- Also tables, quotes, code blocks",
  "# 芙宁娜 · 使用说明\n\n左边写 Markdown，右边立刻排成一页纸。\n\n## 支持的语法\n\n- 标题、**粗体**、*斜体*、`行内代码`\n- 列表可以嵌套\n  1. 缩进两个空格就算下一层\n  2. 有序无序都认\n- 还有引用、代码块、表格、分割线\n\n> 把水搅浑很容易，把水看清楚很难。\n> —— 这行也是引用的一部分。\n\n### 代码块\n\n```js\nconst regions = [\"枫丹\", \"歌剧\", \"审判\"];\nregions.forEach((name) => console.log(name));\n```\n\n### 表格\n\n| 语法 | 说明 | 数量 |\n| :--- | :--- | ---: |\n| 标题 | 一到六级 | 6 |\n| 表格 | 支持对齐写法 | 1 |\n| 代码块 | 语言标记可选 | 3 |\n\n---\n\n尖括号这类字符会被转义，直接写 <script> 也不会被执行。": "# FUninna · Instructions for use\n\nMarkdown is written on the left, and a page is immediately arranged on the right.\n\n## Supported syntax\n\n- Titles, **bold**, *italics*, `inline code`\n- Lists can be nested\n  1. Indent two spaces to move to the next level\n  2. Recognize both order and disorder\n- There are also quotes, code blocks, tables, and dividing lines\n\n> It is easy to muddy the water, but difficult to see clearly.\n> -- This line is also part of the quote.\n\n### Code block\n\n```js\nconst regions = [\"Fontaine\", \"Opera\", \"Trial\"];\nregions.forEach((name) => console.log(name));\n```\n\n### Table\n\n| Syntax | Description | Quantity |\n| :--- | :--- | ---: |\n| Title | Levels 1 to 6 | 6 |\n| Table | Support aligned writing | 1 |\n| code block | language tag optional | 3 |\n\n---\n\nCharacters such as angle brackets will be escaped, and <script> will not be executed if written directly.",
