  "各位同事：\n\n感谢大家在上一版发布中的付出。我们比计划提前完成了三个主要功能，用户反馈也很积极。\n\n下个季度我们重点做性能优化。请在周五之前看完路线图文档，并把意见写在文档里。\n\n祝好\n芙宁娜": "Dear colleagues:\n\nThanks to everyone for their efforts in the last release. We completed three major features ahead of schedule, and user feedback has been very positive.\n\nNext quarter we will focus on performance optimization. Please read the roadmap document before Friday and write your comments in the document.\n\nbest wishes\nFonina",
