  "基于 Tauri v2 纯本地引擎，FFmpeg 音视频转换、OCR 提取与 AI 模型推演均在您本地设备直接运行，不设任何中心化收集节点。": "Based on the Tauri v2 purely local engine, FFmpeg audio and video conversion, OCR extraction and AI model deduction are all run directly on your local device without any centralized collection nodes.",
  "基于前馈条件自编码网络架构，学习图像灰度空间与丰富色彩先验的映射关系，智能推断画面景深、光影过渡与合理的色彩饱和度分布。": "Based on the feedforward conditional autoencoding network architecture, learn the mapping relationship between image grayscale space and rich color priors, and intelligently infer the depth of field, light and shadow transition and reasonable color saturation distribution of the image.",
  "基于双层嵌套 U 型结构 (ReSQU) 设计，无需依赖大参数量骨干网络，兼顾全局结构轮廓与局部边缘的高效捕获，适合大量素材批量预处理。": "Based on the double-layer nested U-shaped structure (ReSQU) design, it does not need to rely on a large parameter backbone network, taking into account the efficient capture of global structure contours and local edges, and is suitable for batch preprocessing of a large number of materials.",
  "基于快速傅里叶卷积 (Fast Fourier Convolution, FFC) 神经架构，具备超大感受野与高频纹理全局一致性推断能力，有效解决大面积遮挡修复时的模糊与断裂问题。": "Based on the Fast Fourier Convolution (FFC) neural architecture, it has a large receptive field and the ability to infer the global consistency of high-frequency textures, effectively solving the blur and fracture problems when repairing large-area occlusions.",
  "基于短时傅里叶变换 (STFT) 与复合频域残差网络结构，针对人声泛音频段深度建模，实现低相位失真的纯净人声独立音轨输出。": "Based on short-time Fourier transform (STFT) and composite frequency domain residual network structure, deep modeling of the vocal overtone band is achieved to achieve pure vocal independent track output with low phase distortion.",
