  "投资期数": "Investment period",
  "投资期数 n": "Investment period n",
  "抖动": "Jitter",
  "抖动用 Floyd–Steinberg 误差扩散，照片层次更自然，但同色块会碎成更细的颗粒。": "Dithering uses Floyd–Steinberg error diffusion. The photo gradation is more natural, but the blocks of the same color will be broken into finer particles.",
