  "持仓 {0} 股，成本价 {1} 元/股\n现价后市值 {2} 元\n浮动盈亏 {3} 元（{4}%）\n已实现盈亏 {5} 元\n合计 {6} 元": "Position {0} shares, cost price {1} yuan/share\nMarket value after current price {2} yuan\nFloating profit and loss {3} yuan ({4}%)\nRealized profit and loss {5} yuan\nTotal {6} yuan",
