  "按 RFC 6238 在本机生成两步验证动态口令：粘贴 otpauth 链接或 Base32 密钥即可，显示剩余有效秒数，密钥不上传": "Generate a two-step verification dynamic password locally according to RFC 6238: just paste the otpauth link or Base32 key, and the remaining valid seconds will be displayed. The key will not be uploaded.",
