  "按 m : n 内分或外分线段求分点坐标，以及中点与线段长度。": "Divide the line segment internally or externally according to m : n to find the coordinates of the dividing point, as well as the midpoint and the length of the line segment.",
  "按 {0} 输入数字，或点下方按键": "Press {0} to enter the number, or click the button below",
  "按\"固定周期\"推算，实际会受作息、压力、身体状况影响而波动，前后差几天很正常。 仅用于日常安排参考；如果周期长期紊乱、疼痛严重或想避孕/备孕，请咨询医生，不要依赖这个预测。": "Calculated based on the \"fixed period\", the actual period will fluctuate due to work and rest, stress, and physical condition. It is normal to have a difference of a few days. It is only used as a reference for daily arrangements; if your cycle is long-term disordered, the pain is severe, or you want to prevent pregnancy/pregnancy, please consult your doctor and do not rely on this prediction.",
  "按{0}": "Press {0}",
