  "按上次月经与周期长度预测未来六次经期、易孕期与排卵日，并说明当前处于哪个阶段": "Predict the next six menstrual periods, fertile periods and ovulation days based on the last menstrual period and cycle length, and indicate which stage you are currently in.",
