  "按分批买入卖出记录算出摊薄成本价、持仓市值、浮动与已实现盈亏，并把佣金、印花税等费用一并计入，给出保本价": "Calculate the diluted cost price, position market value, floating and realized profit and loss based on batch buying and selling records, and include commissions, stamp duties and other expenses together to give the capital-guaranteed price",
  "按分类查语法，点击条目送入右侧验证。使用 JavaScript 正则引擎。": "Check the grammar by category, click on the entry and send it to the right for verification. Use JavaScript regex engine.",
