  "按帧率换算时间轴": "Convert timeline by frame rate",
  "按年复利、期间不再追加本金；收益率请填小数（5% → 0.05）": "Compound interest annually, no additional principal will be added during the period; please fill in the decimal for the rate of return (5% → 0.05)",
  "按当前体重、目标体重与计划周期算出每天该吃多少、缺口多大、是否过快，并直接告诉你会消耗在哪个日期达成目标": "Calculate how much you should eat every day, how big the gap is, and whether it is too fast based on your current weight, target weight, and planning period, and directly tell you which date you will consume to achieve your goal.",
  "按当前满充容量，满电可持续使用约": "Based on the current full charge capacity, a full charge can last for approximately",
  "按当前设置保留了注释。": "Comments are preserved as currently set.",
  "按性别、年龄、身高、体重与活动量算出基础代谢与每日总消耗，给出减脂、维持、增肌三档热量参考，并附 BMI、理想体重与两种公式对照": "Calculate basal metabolism and total daily consumption according to gender, age, height, weight and activity level, and provide three-level caloric reference for fat loss, maintenance, and muscle gain, with comparison of BMI, ideal weight, and two formulas.",
