  "按清单编辑 PDF 页面：删除、复制、旋转、移动到指定位置、插入空白页、整份倒序，还能把另一份 PDF 追加进来；左侧看缩略图多选页面，右侧排好操作顺序一次执行": "Edit PDF pages according to the list: delete, copy, rotate, move to a specified position, insert a blank page, reverse the entire copy, and append another PDF; see the thumbnail multi-select page on the left, and arrange the operations in one order on the right",
