  "按租赁金额 0.1%": "0.1% of lease amount",
  "按空间填充曲线把整幅图的像素沿曲线顺序重新排列。相邻像素重排后仍然相邻，画面呈平滑纹理； 由于保留了邻域相关性，即使经过 JPEG 二次压缩也仍有较大概率还原，解混淆时可 1:1 无损还原， 适用于任意尺寸。": "According to the space filling curve, the pixels of the entire image are rearranged sequentially along the curve. Adjacent pixels are still adjacent after rearrangement, and the picture shows a smooth texture; because the neighborhood correlation is retained, there is still a high probability of restoration even after JPEG secondary compression. It can be restored losslessly at 1:1 during deobfuscation, and is suitable for any size.",
