  "支持 MP3 / FLAC / M4A / OGG / WAV。想先看看现在有哪些标签，可以用「媒体信息查看器」": "Support MP3 / FLAC / M4A / OGG / WAV. If you want to see what tags are available now, you can use the \"Media Information Viewer\"",
