  "支持多选，通过家庭 Wi-Fi 极速直连电脑，不耗手机移动流量": "Supports multiple selections and can be directly connected to a computer through home Wi-Fi without consuming mobile data.",
  "支持小数或任意文本": "Supports decimals or arbitrary text",
  "支持嵌套的 @media / @supports / @keyframes。引号里与 url() 里的内容不参与空白压缩。": "Support nested @media / @supports / @keyframes. Content within quotation marks and url() does not participate in whitespace compression.",
  "支持常见音频与视频格式；视频文件将先自动提取音轨再识别": "Supports common audio and video formats; video files will automatically extract audio tracks first and then recognize them.",
