  "数据为每 100 克可食部的近似值，来自公开食物成分表与品牌营养标签。 同一食材因品种、部位、做法（蒸煮煎炸）差别可以很大，这里给的是量级参考。 每日参考摄入量按 2000 千卡膳食计算（成人常见基准）。": "Data are approximate edible portions per 100g and are derived from published food ingredient lists and brand nutrition labels. The same ingredients can vary greatly depending on their variety, parts, and cooking methods (steaming, cooking, and frying). What is given here is a reference to the magnitude. The daily reference intake is based on a 2000 kcal meal (a common benchmark for adults).",
