  "新增「函数图像」：画二维曲线和三维曲面，可缩放旋转，能读出零点、极值、切线与积分面积": "Added \"Function Image\": draw two-dimensional curves and three-dimensional surfaces, can be zoomed and rotated, and can read zero points, extreme values, tangents and integrated areas",
  "新增「单位换算」：原来的长度、面积、体积、重量、时间、字节等多个换算工具合并成一个，共 28 类 363 个单位": "Added \"Unit Conversion\": the original length, area, volume, weight, time, bytes and other conversion tools are merged into one, with a total of 28 categories and 363 units.",
  "新增「多语言翻译」：21 种语言互译，自动识别源语言，支持长文分段与逐句对照": "Added \"Multi-language Translation\": 21 languages for mutual translation, automatic identification of source language, support for long text segmentation and sentence-by-sentence comparison",
  "新增「时间管理大师」：数字时钟、模拟时钟、倒计时、闹钟、倒数日、秒表，支持一键全屏": "Added \"Time Management Master\": digital clock, analog clock, countdown, alarm clock, countdown day, stopwatch, supports one-click full screen",
  "新增「系统工具」与「AI 工具」两个分类，并补入视觉识别、演示文稿、桌面端等方向的能力，工具总数由 148 个增加到 192 个": "Added two new categories: \"System Tools\" and \"AI Tools\", and added capabilities in visual recognition, presentations, desktop and other directions. The total number of tools increased from 148 to 192.",
  "新增「进出口贸易计算台」：含税与不含税单价互转、出口成本与利润、FOB/CFR/CIF 报价、进口环节税与运费分摊": "Added \"Import and Export Trade Calculation Platform\": interchange of tax-included and tax-exclusive unit prices, export costs and profits, FOB/CFR/CIF quotations, import link taxes and freight allocation",
  "新增「高等数学运算」：求导、极限、积分、级数、微分方程、矩阵与向量，都有分步过程": "New \"Advanced Mathematical Operations\": derivation, limit, integral, series, differential equation, matrix and vector, all have step-by-step procedures",
  "新增六个工具，多个老工具重做，并重新划分了工具分类": "Six new tools have been added, many old tools have been redone, and tool categories have been reclassified.",
  "新增功能 · 磁力链接与 BT 种子高速下载": "New features · Magnet link and BT torrent high-speed download",
  "新增功能 · 跨设备互传与文件伪装": "New features · Cross-device transfer and file camouflage",
  "新增四十余个工具：本地 OCR、图片去水印、PDF 编辑器与桌面端能力": "Added more than 40 new tools: local OCR, image watermark removal, PDF editor and desktop capabilities",
  "新增实用好玩的新工具": "Added new practical and fun tools",
  "新增工具": "New tool",
  "新增平滑进度显示，下载过程中实时呈现当前百分比、下载速率和剩余时间，心中有数不焦虑": "Added smooth progress display. During the download process, the current percentage, download rate and remaining time are displayed in real time, so you know what to do and don’t worry.",
  "新增按需下载机制：较大的模型不随安装包分发，用到时在设置里下载即可，支持断点续传与单独删除。本次安装包仅增加约 53MB": "Added a new on-demand download mechanism: larger models are not distributed with the installation package. You can download them in the settings when needed. Breakpoint resumption and individual deletion are supported. This installation package only adds about 53MB",
  "新增文件智能保护机制：如果下载目录已存在同名完整视频，直接识别为已完成并提供播放按钮，绝不误清空文件": "New intelligent file protection mechanism: If a complete video with the same name already exists in the download directory, it will be directly recognized as completed and a play button will be provided, and the file will never be cleared by mistake.",
