  "用高斯消元（列主元）把增广矩阵化成阶梯形，再回代求出唯一解": "Use Gaussian elimination (column pivot) to transform the augmented matrix into a ladder shape, and then back-substitute to find the unique solution",
  "田": "Tian",
  "由": "By",
  "由 CIF = CFR + 保险费 反解得到。分母里的「投保加成」是系数（110% → 1.1）；如果按加成率 10% 填，系数就是 1 + 10%。": "Obtained from the back solution of CIF = CFR + insurance premium. The \"insurance bonus\" in the denominator is the coefficient (110% → 1.1); if the bonus rate is 10%, the coefficient is 1 + 10%.",
  "由 F({0}, {1}) = 0 确定的隐函数": "Implicit function determined by F({0}, {1}) = 0",
  "由 FurinaKit 制作": "Made by FurinaKit",
  "由三个顶点坐标求重心、垂心、外心、内心，以及外接圆、内切圆与各边长。": "Find the center of gravity, orthocenter, circumcenter, incenter, as well as the circumscribed circle, inscribed circle and the length of each side from the three vertex coordinates.",
  "由上下底半径与高求体积、母线、侧面积与全面积。": "Find the volume, busbar, side area and total area from the upper and lower base radii and height.",
  "由两直角边求斜边、由斜边与一直角边求另一边，以及三维空间的对角线。": "Find the hypotenuse from two right-angled sides, find the other side from the hypotenuse and the right-angled side, and the diagonal in three-dimensional space.",
  "由两邻边加夹角、底加高或两邻边加一条对角线求面积、两条对角线、高与各角。": "Find the area, two diagonals, height and angles by adding the angle between two adjacent sides, adding the height of the base, or adding a diagonal line between two adjacent sides.",
  "由体积反求半径": "Reverse radius from volume",
  "由内角和求边数": "Find the number of sides from the sum of interior angles",
  "由半径加高（或半径加体积）求体积、侧面积、全面积与轴截面数据。": "Find volume, side area, total area and axial cross-section data from radius plus height (or radius plus volume).",
  "由半径加高（或半径加母线）求体积、侧面积、全面积与侧面展开扇形的圆心角。": "Calculate the volume, side area, total area and central angle of the side expanded sector by using the radius plus height (or radius plus busbar).",
  "由半长轴与半短轴求面积、周长（拉马努金近似）、离心率、焦点与准线。": "Find the area, perimeter (Ramanujan approximation), eccentricity, focus and directrix from the semi-major axis and semi-minor axis.",
  "由含税价倒推不含税价用的是除法：「含税 ÷ (1 + 税率)」，不是「含税 × (1 − 税率)」。": "To calculate the tax-exclusive price from the tax-included price, the division method is used: \"tax-included ÷ (1 + tax rate)\", not \"tax-included × (1 - tax rate)\".",
  "由圆心半径、三点、一般式或圆心与圆上一点求圆的标准方程与一般方程。": "Find the standard and general equations of a circle from the center radius, three points, general formulas, or the center and a point on the circle.",
  "由密钥生成混沌序列来决定像素的重排顺序；换密钥则结果不同，还原时需填写": "The chaotic sequence is generated by the key to determine the rearrangement order of the pixels; if the key is changed, the result will be different, which needs to be filled in when restoring.",
  "由对应边求相似比、周长比与面积比，并求出未知的对应边长。": "Find the similarity ratio, perimeter ratio and area ratio from the corresponding sides, and find the unknown corresponding side length.",
  "由底面半径与高求球半径": "Find the sphere radius from the base radius and height",
  "由当前输入推出的圆心角不在 0° ~ 360° 之间，请检查数据": "The central angle derived from the current input is not between 0° ~ 360°, please check the data",
  "由拖框界面自动生成，一般无需手动填写": "Automatically generated by drag-and-drop interface, generally no need to fill in manually",
  "由棱长、体积或体对角线求表面积、内外接球与各种对角线。": "Calculate surface area from edge length, volume or body diagonal, internal and external spheres and various diagonals.",
  "由每个内角求边数": "Find the number of sides from each interior angle",
  "由腰与底（或腰与顶角）求三边三角、底边高、面积与内外接圆。": "Find the three-sided triangle, base height, area and inner and outer circles from the waist and base (or waist and vertex angle).",
  "由表达式逐层解出，不是数值近似": "It is solved layer by layer from the expression, not a numerical approximation",
  "由表面积反求半径": "Reverse radius from surface area",
  "由较高条件倒推较低条件时，运费是减项；运费高于该条件价时结果会失真，已做拦截。": "When the lower condition is deduced from the higher condition, the freight is a deducted item; when the freight is higher than the condition price, the result will be distorted and has been intercepted.",
  "由边长加角、两条对角线或边长加高求面积、对角线、高与内切圆。": "Find area, diagonal, height and inscribed circle from side length plus angle, two diagonals or side length plus height.",
  "由长宽、一边加对角线或一边加面积求解矩形的全部量。": "Find the total quantities of a rectangle from its length and width, one side plus its diagonal, or one side plus its area.",
  "由长宽高求体积、表面积、体对角线、外接球与各面对角线。": "Find the volume, surface area, body diagonal, circumscribed sphere and diagonals of each side from the length, width and height.",
  "由面积反求半径": "Reverse radius from area",
  "由面积比求相似比": "Finding similarity ratio from area ratio",
  "由顶点坐标求任意多边形的面积（鞋带公式）、周长、形心、边长与凸凹性。": "Calculate the area (shoelace formula), perimeter, centroid, side length and convexity of any polygon from vertex coordinates.",
  "甲": "A",
  "甲乙双方依据平等自愿、互惠互利的合作原则，就数字化工具箱平台与智能签名交互组件的技术研发达成友好一致意向。 双方共同确认项目成果归属双方共享，本协议落款经双方签字或加盖电子印鉴后即时生效。": "Based on the cooperation principles of equality, voluntariness, and mutual benefit, Party A and Party B have reached a friendly agreement on the technical research and development of the digital toolbox platform and smart signature interactive components. Both parties jointly confirm that the project results belong to both parties and will be shared by both parties. This agreement will take effect immediately after being signed or electronically stamped by both parties.",
  "甲方（授权机构）：": "Party A (authorized agency):",
