  "：Whirlpool 已非现行标准推荐、MD6 从未被标准化， 两者申请场景极少；bcrypt / scrypt 属于口令存储算法，需要成本因子与盐，交互形态与工具类场景不符。": ": Whirlpool is no longer recommended by current standards, and MD6 has never been standardized. There are very few application scenarios for both; bcrypt / scrypt is a password storage algorithm that requires a cost factor and salt, and the interaction form is not consistent with tool scenarios.",
  "：只在所选文件夹下建「_重复待删除」目录并按原目录结构放进去， 确认无误后再自行清理；后悔了直接移回来即可。": ": Only create the \"_duplicate to be deleted\" directory under the selected folder and put it in according to the original directory structure. After confirming that it is correct, clean it up yourself; if you regret it, just move it back.",
