  "：用哪种方式混淆，就必须用同一种方式还原； 本工具提供的两种方式互不通用。": ": Whichever method is used to obfuscate, it must be restored in the same way; the two methods provided by this tool are not mutually exclusive.",
  "：裁剪、缩放、平台二次压缩都会破坏像素位置的对应关系， 导致无法还原；建议以 PNG 格式保存与传输。": ": Cropping, scaling, and platform secondary compression will destroy the corresponding relationship between pixel positions, making it impossible to restore; it is recommended to save and transmit in PNG format.",
