  "🌟 专为电脑端打造的全新独立桌面软件，融入水神芙宁娜主题与精致毛玻璃设计": "🌟 A new independent desktop software specially created for computers, integrating the theme of Water Goddess Furina and exquisite frosted glass design",
  "🎉 云端发现全新版本，包含新功能与稳定性优化！": "🎉 A new version was discovered in the cloud, including new features and stability optimization!",
  "🎉 享受小规模纳税人月度不含税销售额≤10万元免税政策！": "🎉 Enjoy the tax exemption policy for small-scale taxpayers with monthly tax-exclusive sales of ≤100,000 yuan!",
  "🎉 彻底解决视频下载卡在 40% 的烦心问题：B站、YouTube等平台视频下载一路畅通通畅到底": "🎉 Completely solves the annoying problem of video download stuck at 40%: video downloads from Bilibili, YouTube and other platforms are smooth all the way to the end",
  "🎨 视觉主题新增「跟随系统」模式与护眼高对比度优化：自动感知 Windows 系统浅色/深色主题，优化护眼模式文字与按键识别度": "🎨 The visual theme adds \"Follow the system\" mode and Eye Comfort high contrast optimization: automatically detects the light/dark theme of the Windows system, and optimizes the Eye Comfort text and button recognition",
  "🎬 原画质与纯音频自由选：1080P超清视频一键保存，还可以直接提取成纯MP3音频放手机听歌": "🎬 Free choice between original image quality and pure audio: 1080P ultra-clear video can be saved with one click, and can also be directly extracted into pure MP3 audio for listening to music on your mobile phone",
  "🎭 全新上线「图片混淆/反混淆」：空间映射与像素打乱双重混淆，支持自定义密码与高级隐写，可逆无损一键还原": "🎭 Newly launched \"image obfuscation/anti-obfuscation\": double obfuscation of spatial mapping and pixel shuffling, supports custom passwords and advanced steganography, reversible and lossless one-click restoration",
  "👀 界面翻页记忆与置顶优化：退出工具后自动回到刚才浏览的位置，不用再翻来覆去寻找": "👀 Interface page turning memory and top optimization: after exiting the tool, you will automatically return to the location you just browsed, no need to search over and over again.",
  "💡 公式：不含税额 = 含税额 ÷ (1 + 税率)；税额 = 不含税额 × 税率。": "💡 Formula: Excluding tax = Amount including tax ÷ (1 + tax rate); Tax amount = Excluding tax × Tax rate.",
  "💡 公式：进口关税 = CIF × 关税率；进口增值税 = (CIF + 关税 + 消费税) × 增值税率。": "💡 Formula: Import tariff = CIF × tariff rate; Import VAT = (CIF + tariff + consumption tax) × VAT rate.",
  "💡 城建税以实际缴纳的两税为基数；免抵税额也纳入计征范围。": "💡 Urban construction tax is based on the two taxes actually paid; tax exemptions and credits are also included in the calculation scope.",
  "💡 左右拖拽中间把柄对比画质变化；使用键盘 ← / → 方向键切换图片": "💡 Drag the middle handle left and right to compare the image quality changes; use the keyboard ← / → arrow keys to switch images",
  "💾 视频与种子双重自动备份：视频下载完成时自动备份一份种子文件，方便离线转存网盘或分享好友": "💾 Double automatic backup of videos and seeds: a torrent file is automatically backed up when the video is downloaded, which is convenient for offline transfer to network disk or sharing with friends",
  "📁 智能自动维护本地缓存：首次运行自动整理工作目录，多任务同时处理也井井有条": "📁 Intelligent automatic maintenance of local cache: automatically organizes the working directory on the first run, and multi-tasking is also organized at the same time",
  "📄 优化图片转 PDF 核心算法，大幅压缩输出体积，杜绝膨胀同时保持原生超高清画质": "📄 Optimize the core algorithm of image conversion to PDF, greatly compress the output volume, eliminate expansion while maintaining the native ultra-high-definition image quality",
  "📄 文档与 PDF 转换稳定性大提升：Word、PPT、Excel 转换更加迅速，排版原汁原味": "📄 The stability of document and PDF conversion has been greatly improved: Word, PPT, and Excel conversion are faster and the typesetting is original.",
  "📊 真实流畅的下载进度条：下载进度从 0% 到 100% 实时跳动，剩余时间和下载速度看得一清二楚": "📊 Real and smooth download progress bar: the download progress jumps from 0% to 100% in real time, and the remaining time and download speed are clearly visible",
  "📌 印花税法自2022年7月1日起施行，未列明的合同（如普通劳务合同）不征收印花税。": "📌 The Stamp Duty Law will come into effect on July 1, 2022, and no stamp duty will be levied on unspecified contracts (such as ordinary labor contracts).",
  "📌 小微企业判定：从事国家非限制和禁止行业，年度应纳税所得额不超过300万元、从业人数不超过300人、资产总额不超过5000万元。": "📌 Determination of small and micro enterprises: engaged in national unrestricted and prohibited industries, annual taxable income does not exceed 3 million yuan, number of employees does not exceed 300, and total assets do not exceed 50 million yuan.",
  "📌 消费税为单一环节征收的价内税，主要针对烟、酒、贵重首饰、成品油、小汽车等特定商品。": "📌 Consumption tax is an in-price tax levied at a single stage, mainly targeting specific commodities such as tobacco, alcohol, precious jewelry, refined oil, and cars.",
  "📌 起征点标准：基本减除费用 5,000元/月 (60,000元/年)。个人所得税法已由汇算清缴全面合并实施。": "📌 Threshold standard: Basic deduction fee is 5,000 yuan/month (60,000 yuan/year). The Personal Income Tax Law has been fully consolidated and implemented by the final settlement and settlement.",
  "📚 书籍 {0} 本   🎬 电影 {1} 部   📺 番剧 {2} 部": "📚 {0} books 🎬 {1} movies 📺 {2} dramas",
