  "📲 全新推出「跨设备互传」：手机电脑高速直连，连接同一 Wi-Fi 或手机热点，手机免装 App 扫码即传，双向满速互通并支持剪贴板实时同步": "📲 Newly launched \"cross-device mutual transmission\": high-speed direct connection between mobile phones and computers, connected to the same Wi-Fi or mobile hotspot, no need to install an app on the mobile phone to scan the QR code, two-way full-speed interoperability and supports real-time clipboard synchronization",
  "📺 文娱记录中心全面升级：不仅能记书单、看电影，还能追踪追番追剧进度，集数打卡超方便": "📺 The entertainment record center has been fully upgraded: it can not only record book lists and watch movies, but also track the progress of watching TV series and episodes. It is very convenient to check in the episode number.",
  "🔄 全局任务断点接管与悬浮球无缝续展：点击浮球即刻秒回专属工作台接管正在运行的任务，杜绝状态丢失": "🔄 Global task breakpoint takeover and floating ball seamless renewal: Click the floating ball to instantly return to the exclusive workbench to take over the running task, eliminating status loss",
  "🔄 软件更新与后台服务全面优化：告别繁琐设置，一键全自动检测与智能快速升级": "🔄 Comprehensive optimization of software updates and background services: Say goodbye to cumbersome settings, one-click fully automatic detection and intelligent rapid upgrades",
  "🔍 贴心「先预览后下载」：粘贴链接就能提前看到资源名称、总容量和文件清单，绝不下错资源": "🔍 Intimate \"Preview first and then download\": Paste the link to see the resource name, total capacity and file list in advance, so you will never download the wrong resource.",
  "🔒 本地数据处理：所有照片、文档均在您自己的电脑上处理，文件内容不外传": "🔒 Local data processing: All photos and documents are processed on your own computer, and the file content will not be transmitted externally.",
  "🔖 你的查询码": "🔖 Your query code",
  "🖼️ 图片处理工具全部恢复正常：格式转换、压缩、调整尺寸再也不会弹出莫名其妙的报错了": "🖼️ All image processing tools have returned to normal: format conversion, compression, and resizing will no longer cause inexplicable errors to pop up.",
  "🖼️ 图片强化全新支持「批量超分与原图对比」：上限 50 张并发，自适应各品牌显卡加速与低显存保护，随时无缝滑动对比原图": "🖼️ Image enhancement supports \"batch super score and original image comparison\": up to 50 concurrent images, adaptive graphics card acceleration and low memory protection of various brands, seamless sliding comparison of original images at any time",
  "🗃️ 全新上线「文件伪装为图片」：将任意私密文件或压缩包融入图片，双击正常看图，改后缀为 .zip 或解密即见真实文件": "🗃️ Newly launched \"File Disguised as Picture\": Integrate any private file or compressed package into the picture, double-click to view the picture normally, change the suffix to .zip or decrypt to see the real file",
  "🚀 下载引擎脱胎换骨：彻底移除了后台易卡顿的内部调用，响应更快，占用内存更低": "🚀 The download engine has been completely reborn: the internal calls that cause lag in the background have been completely removed, resulting in faster response and lower memory usage.",
  "🛠️ 升级修复核心图像计算包：即使完全断网，也能独立完成所有图片与照片的高画质处理": "🛠️ Upgraded and repaired the core image calculation package: even if the Internet is completely disconnected, high-quality processing of all images and photos can be completed independently",
  "🛡️ 智能防误删与一键直达：已下载好的视频智能识别秒开，新增「打开所在文件夹」快捷按钮": "🛡️ Intelligent prevention of accidental deletion and one-click direct access: downloaded videos are intelligently recognized and opened instantly, and a new \"Open the folder\" shortcut button is added",
  "🧮 全新重构「税金税率计算」与「高级函数计算」：涵盖个人所得税、增值税、企业所得税等全税种专业计算；函数计算支持丰富函数与精度自由定制": "🧮 Newly reconstructed \"Tax Rate Calculation\" and \"Advanced Function Calculation\": covering professional calculations of all tax types such as personal income tax, value-added tax, corporate income tax, etc.; Function Calculation supports rich functions and free customization of precision",
  "🧮 科学计算器全新重构：支持复杂科学函数与程序员多进制换算，大数计算精度更准": "🧮 New reconstruction of scientific calculator: supports complex scientific functions and multi-base conversion for programmers, making large number calculations more accurate",
  "🧰 100+ 款离线工具开箱即用：图片、音视频、PDF、格式转换应有尽有，不连网也能用": "🧰 100+ offline tools are ready to use out of the box: pictures, audio and video, PDF, format conversion, everything is available, and can be used even if you are not connected to the Internet",
