  "语音合成 (TTS)：全面支持 Edge 在线大模型、Windows 原生声线与离线模型，生成前可随时试听与调节语速语调": "Text-to-Speech (TTS): Edge AI neural voices, Windows native SAPI, and offline models with preview and pitch/speed adjustments",
