  "快递单号查询：重构主流快递轨迹解析，消除反爬误报，顺丰免手机号直接查单，支持各大承运商官网单号直达": "Parcel tracking: Refactored carrier trajectory parsing, SF express tracking without phone verification, and carrier site direct links",
