  "新增悬浮球与全局快捷键，支持直接将文件拖入到悬浮球中，直达相关工具页面，支持自定义悬浮球小窗格工具，支持主界面与常用工具全局自定义快捷键": "Added desktop floating ball & global hotkeys: Direct drag-and-drop files into the floating ball to navigate instantly to tool pages, customize floating ball quick-access grid tools, and set custom global hotkeys for the main window and frequent tools",
